==Description==
The '''Blighted''' is a tanky enemy that appears in [[Hardcore Mode|Hardcore]] and [[Voidcore Mode|Voidcore]] modes. Its first debut spawned at Wave 19 in [[Hardcore Mode|Hardcore]] mode and Wave 18 in [[Voidcore Mode|Voidcore]] mode, which combined with its high health and average speed makes it a decent threat.

==Appearance==
The '''Blighted''' has grey skin. Its body is torn apart on its head and arms, exposing its glowing pink insides. It only wears purple pants and a belt. On its body, it has grey veins and multiple pink flowers.

==Strategy==
*Towers that deal high DPS, such as the [[Saboteur]], [[Crook Boss]], [[Engineer]] or [[Golden Minigunner]] are recommended against the '''Blighted'''.
*The first '''Blighted''' that spawns is a [[Boss]] enemy, making it harder to stall. Therefore, stalling towers such as the [[Freezer]] and [[Electroshocker]] are not recommended against it for its debut.
**Afterwards, it will always have the [[Stun Immunity]], making stunning towers only slow it down.
**On certain waves it will also spawn in with the [[Freeze Immunity]], making freezing towers do nothing to it.

